                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a330b4a-0809-3b64-aa7d-854ee0bb5b8c",
                        "entry_id": "1d86c4c0-128a-3ad5-a3d4-9d6d44e77483",
                        "glosses": [
                            "любитель и знаток книг, собиратель редких и ценных изданий"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "68635e36-41da-495d-9c9d-0ff9eba5f647",
                                "sense_id": "4a330b4a-0809-3b64-aa7d-854ee0bb5b8c",
                                "text": "Наконец и библиофилы будут благодарны за типографическую изящность издания: «Словарь» .. есть отличное произведение типографии Второго отделения .."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "20cb5e78-0609-4999-925e-9f36d89485eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d86c4c0-128a-3ad5-a3d4-9d6d44e77483",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a330b4a-0809-3b64-aa7d-854ee0bb5b8c",
                        "target_lang_word": "bibliophile",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bibliophile",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e38cb6e6-be5e-315a-b3a4-b96587435f9e",
                                        "entry_id": "cea777fa-e297-3bce-a877-88a90d7e8689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who loves books."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e23c9ff1-c974-4931-a2d7-efb259fa3b1a",
                                                "sense_id": "e38cb6e6-be5e-315a-b3a4-b96587435f9e",
                                                "text": "A bad example often finds imitators, and every season there crop up for public sale one or two such collections formed by bibliomaniacs who, although calling themselves bibliophiles, ought really to be ranked among the worst enemies of books."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfdb168d-1011-4ea5-871d-0c2406528363",
                                                "sense_id": "e38cb6e6-be5e-315a-b3a4-b96587435f9e",
                                                "text": "[A] savage passage of 14th-century invective about the text-obsessed nerdiness of the Florentine bibliophile and friend of Petrarch, Niccolò Niccoli ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b228a0ab-c254-306a-8d68-144409dffa4f",
                                        "entry_id": "cea777fa-e297-3bce-a877-88a90d7e8689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who collects books, not necessarily due to any interest in reading them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14183ef1-9a1f-4209-a4d7-83ed0382d8df",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d86c4c0-128a-3ad5-a3d4-9d6d44e77483",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a330b4a-0809-3b64-aa7d-854ee0bb5b8c",
                        "target_lang_word": "bibliófilo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bibliófilo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b386794c-1fe2-3d13-b480-0ebb357d21ff",
                                        "entry_id": "a4031e46-d458-30b0-8665-acd854d2daf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que ama o tiene afición por los libros, en especial por ediciones con características especiales."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "noun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b4202d4-1ce1-41df-9b5f-6dfe6c122aec",
                                                "sense_id": "b386794c-1fe2-3d13-b480-0ebb357d21ff",
                                                "text": "libros que él coleccionaba como antiguos y que era una inconsciente iniciación de su tendencia bibliófila"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b523579-243b-4362-8bac-4b85a5dbf520",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d86c4c0-128a-3ad5-a3d4-9d6d44e77483",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a330b4a-0809-3b64-aa7d-854ee0bb5b8c",
                        "target_lang_word": "bibliofilo",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd11d107-f35a-4a8b-aaa7-3ff03893cf05",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d86c4c0-128a-3ad5-a3d4-9d6d44e77483",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a330b4a-0809-3b64-aa7d-854ee0bb5b8c",
                        "target_lang_word": "bibliophile",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bibliophile",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d118f508-a5ee-31c1-995f-e6164c15872f",
                                        "entry_id": "13607d8b-0ad1-30e1-932a-9f9351150f38",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Amateur de livres rares et précieux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82aaa7ef-5f17-4b7e-858e-01f4dda6d5d4",
                                                "sense_id": "d118f508-a5ee-31c1-995f-e6164c15872f",
                                                "text": "Un bûcher où le bois était rangé avec autant d’exactitude que peuvent l’être les livres d’un bibliophile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "787ea2ca-722d-4e6d-88d1-90a4708526b0",
                                                "sense_id": "d118f508-a5ee-31c1-995f-e6164c15872f",
                                                "text": "À quoi je répondrai qu’un bibliophile sérieux ne communique pas ses livres. Lui-même ne les lit pas, de crainte de les fatiguer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7c68864-1ead-4d0b-a39c-cdc1ab9b81cd",
                                                "sense_id": "d118f508-a5ee-31c1-995f-e6164c15872f",
                                                "text": "Les livres érotiques, qu’on appelle par euphémisme : éditions pour bibliophiles…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fe234ee-38bf-4e9d-8c10-3b8a3aa5c5aa",
                                                "sense_id": "d118f508-a5ee-31c1-995f-e6164c15872f",
                                                "text": "Sans être aucunement bibliophile, j’ai un soin quasi fétichiste de mes livres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be57f2f1-e072-4b7d-aedb-9752fa9b983b",
                                                "sense_id": "d118f508-a5ee-31c1-995f-e6164c15872f",
                                                "text": "Comme il avait passé toute la guerre à acheter et vendre des livres précieux, il connaissait non seulement les bibliophiles et les libraires parisiens que j’ai cités plus haut, mais également les marchands d’autographes, de lettres et manuscrits."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "930dae51-9897-4001-a237-5920da44dee0",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d86c4c0-128a-3ad5-a3d4-9d6d44e77483",
